# Network Architecture

The lab contained both the Raspberry Pi's physical network and a virtual network used by the Ubuntu virtual machine.

```text
                    Local Network
                         │
                         │
                ┌────────▼────────┐
                │  Raspberry Pi 5 │
                │   10.0.0.98     │
